  "description": "Amalgamation of two self-contained flats to create a single family dwelling house and the erection of a single storey roof extension and rear infill extension with external works to the front elevation.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its size, design and position, would result in an overbearing impact and increased sense of enclosure along with a loss of daylight/sunlight which would result in an unacceptable adverse impact on the amenity of the neighbouring occupiers. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) D6 (Housing Quality and Standards) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009.&lt;/p&gt;"
